      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "GRAVITY MONELLI (1) took advantage of the inside draw and gave a big sight in front when second and beaten one length (37.58) at this track in a Grade 5 over 652m. One of the leading chances. CAPALLA (6) filled a minor placing last start at Cannington behind West On Model (43.08) in a Grade 4/5. Led around the bend before fighting on well and should give a sight. Recorded one of the quickest times on the card last start despite being beaten. Expecting another good run. SNAPPY SNACKER (4) broke a string of placings finishing in the money two on end before a last start fourth (38.02) at this track. Form at the trip sound including three wins. Likely to be about the money. JUST A LAD (2) is worth consideration.",
